	<brief_description>
		Resource describing an activatable ability and its tag gating.
	</brief_description>
	<description>
		Identified by its ability name and optionally bound to an input action. Activation is gated by tags: required tags must be present on the owner, blocked tags must be absent, and owned tags are granted for as long as the ability runs.
		Extend in GDScript and override [code]_on_give_ability[/code], [code]_can_activate_ability[/code], [code]_activate_ability[/code], [code]_end_ability[/code] and the input hooks. These are virtual methods to override, not signals to connect to.
	</description>
